doctype html
html
  head
    meta(charset='UTF-8')
    title Employee Login Details

  body
    h2 Hello #{ employeeName },

    p Your employment certificate has been generated successfully.

    p You can access your certificate using the following login details:

    p
      strong Login URL:
      | #{ loginUrl }

    p your login credentials:-

    p
      strong username :
      | #{ email }

    p
      strong Password:
      | #{ password }

    p
      strong Public Key:
    pre #{ publicKey }

    p
      strong Private Key:
    pre #{ privateKey }

    p Please keep these credentials secure.

    p Regards,
    p Codes for Tomorrow
